{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_017wvBjNuu82JFLL9ptnHHLh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01996AVA6YiHcC4f2Noqzw5F","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/cards/fdn\necho \"=== Counter spells: look at specs to pick best ===\"\nfor c in fdn_37 fdn_121 fdn_48; do echo \"--$c--\"; python3 -c \"import json; d=json.load(open('$c/card_spec.json')); print(d['name'],'|',d['type_line']); print(d['oracle_text'])\"; done\necho; echo \"=== Surveil specs ===\"\nfor c in fdn_53 fdn_32 fdn_157; do echo \"--$c--\"; python3 -c \"import json; d=json.load(open('$c/card_spec.json')); print(d['name'],'|',d['type_line']); print(d['oracle_text'])\"; done\necho; echo \"=== mana ability / land specs ===\"\nfor c in fdn_254 fdn_255 fdn_7 fdn_54; do echo \"--$c--\"; python3 -c \"import json; d=json.load(open('$c/card_spec.json')); print(d['name'],'|',d['type_line']); print(d['oracle_text'])\"; done","description":"Inspect counterspell, surveil, land specs"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4525,"cache_read_input_tokens":93448,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4525},"output_tokens":30,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1b7c704-d004-4a3e-ade9-c0cdca9e5add","uuid":"3c686665-8878-49b7-b15f-0135caba8efb","request_id":"req_011CbhvWCKWnnyVWqaPuwCLQ"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01996AVA6YiHcC4f2Noqzw5F","type":"tool_result","content":"=== Counter spells: look at specs to pick best ===\n--fdn_37--\nErudite Wizard | Creature — Human Wizard\nWhenever you draw your second card each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.\n--fdn_121--\nKoma, World-Eater | Legendary Creature — Serpent\nThis spell can't be countered.\nTrample, ward {4}\nWhenever Koma deals combat damage to a player, create four 3/3 blue Serpent creature tokens named Koma's Coil.\n--fdn_48--\nRefute | Instant\nCounter target spell. Draw a card, then discard a card.\n\n=== Surveil specs ===\n--fdn_53--\nUncharted Voyage | Instant\nTarget creature's owner puts it on their choice of the top or bottom of their library.\nSurveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)\n--fdn_32--\nCephalid Inkmage | Creature — Octopus Wizard\nWhen this creature enters, surveil 3. (Look at the top three cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)\nThreshold — This creature can't be blocked as long as there are seven or more cards in your graveyard.\n--fdn_157--\nLightshell Duo | Creature — Rat Otter\nProwess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nWhen this creature enters, surveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)\n\n=== mana ability / land specs ===\n--fdn_254--\nHeraldic Banner | Artifact\nAs this artifact enters, choose a color.\nCreatures you control of the chosen color get +1/+0.\n{T}: Add one mana of the chosen color.\n--fdn_255--\nJuggernaut | Artifact Creature — Juggernaut\nThis creature attacks each combat if able.\nThis creature can't be blocked by Walls.\n--fdn_7--\nCrystal Barricade | Artifact Creature — Wall\nDefender (This creature can't attack.)\nYou have hexproof. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\nPrevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to other creatures you control.\n--fdn_54--\nAbyssal Harvester | Creature — Demon Warlock\n{T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard that was put there this turn. Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a Nightmare in addition to its other types. Then exile all other Nightmare tokens you control.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a1b7c704-d004-4a3e-ade9-c0cdca9e5add","uuid":"658b938b-8991-4dd2-9870-925dac5a80c6","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:43:08.440Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"=== Counter spells: look at specs to pick best ===\n--fdn_37--\nErudite Wizard | Creature — Human Wizard\nWhenever you draw your second card each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.\n--fdn_121--\nKoma, World-Eater | Legendary Creature — Serpent\nThis spell can't be countered.\nTrample, ward {4}\nWhenever Koma deals combat damage to a player, create four 3/3 blue Serpent creature tokens named Koma's Coil.\n--fdn_48--\nRefute | Instant\nCounter target spell. Draw a card, then discard a card.\n\n=== Surveil specs ===\n--fdn_53--\nUncharted Voyage | Instant\nTarget creature's owner puts it on their choice of the top or bottom of their library.\nSurveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)\n--fdn_32--\nCephalid Inkmage | Creature — Octopus Wizard\nWhen this creature enters, surveil 3. (Look at the top three cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)\nThreshold — This creature can't be blocked as long as there are seven or more cards in your graveyard.\n--fdn_157--\nLightshell Duo | Creature — Rat Otter\nProwess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\nWhen this creature enters, surveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)\n\n=== mana ability / land specs ===\n--fdn_254--\nHeraldic Banner | Artifact\nAs this artifact enters, choose a color.\nCreatures you control of the chosen color get +1/+0.\n{T}: Add one mana of the chosen color.\n--fdn_255--\nJuggernaut | Artifact Creature — Juggernaut\nThis creature attacks each combat if able.\nThis creature can't be blocked by Walls.\n--fdn_7--\nCrystal Barricade | Artifact Creature — Wall\nDefender (This creature can't attack.)\nYou have hexproof. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\nPrevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to other creatures you control.\n--fdn_54--\nAbyssal Harvester | Creature — Demon Warlock\n{T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard that was put there this turn. Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a Nightmare in addition to its other types. Then exile all other Nightmare tokens you control.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
