{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   This is a **two-phase task; the agent is the PLANNING agent (Phase 1 of 2)**. The explicit intent is to produce a single, concrete, self-contained file `/workspace/PLAN.md` that a separate implementation agent (running in a fresh session that inherits ONLY PLAN.md, not the reasoning/context) will use to implement 10 Magic: The Gathering SOS cards. The planning agent must NOT write any implementation code.\n\n   The downstream implementation task (described for context in PLAN.md): \"Implement the following SOS cards: 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257 in `/workspace/cards/sos/`.\" Each card has a `card_spec.json` and a `card_impl.py` template. Use completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as examples. Refer to `RULEBOOK.txt`. The implementer is expected to make engine changes for new keywords/mechanics.\n\n   PLAN.md must contain exactly 3 sections:\n   - **(1) Engine gaps** — a table: `| Capability needed | Smallest change | Engine file / seam | Cards that reuse it |`, preferring ONE shared seam reused by several cards.\n   - **(2) Per-card plan** — oracle clauses, nearest FDN analogue, exact engine seam(s) to reuse, new engine changes (referencing gap table), key edge cases worth a test.\n   - **(3) Implementation order** — ordered list of cards + shared engine changes to make FIRST, grouped by shared seam, simplest→hardest, with one-line rationale per group.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG rules engine in pure Python (stdlib only), imported as `engine.*`\n   - CardImpl hook methods: `can_cast`, `cost_reduction`, `on_cast`, `on_resolve`, `get_targets`, `register_triggers`, `register_replacement_effects`, `get_activated_abilities`, `get_modes`; `Planeswalker.get_loyalty_abilities`; `Land.get_mana_abilities`\n   - Typed event system (`engine/events.py`): TriggeredEvent + ReplacementEvent dataclasses; trigger conditions get `(game, event)` but trigger **effects get only `(game)`** (no event)\n   - Continuous effects 7-layer system (Layer IntEnum 1-7, SubLayer 7a-7d), `effect_manager.add(ContinuousEffect(...))`, `apply_all` only runs at cleanup\n   - Replacement effects (only consulted when leaving battlefield)\n   - Free casting via `cast_spell_free`, spell copies via `copy_spell`\n   - Converge / colors_spent tracking, Casualty, Miracle, Affinity, Surveil, Paradigm (custom SOS), Prepared (custom SOS)\n   - Loyalty abilities, mana abilities, activated abilities\n   - DeterministicPlayer (FIFO scripted choices) for testing; test_utils helpers\n   - APNAP trigger ordering; LIFO stack resolution\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - **`/workspace/PLAN.md`** (CREATED — the deliverable):\n     - Contains 4 main sections: \"0. KEY ENGINE FACTS\", \"1. ENGINE GAPS\" (table), \"2. PER-CARD PLANS\", \"3. IMPLEMENTATION ORDER\".\n     - The Engine Gaps table (8 gaps):\n       - **A**: Fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell=card, card=card, player=player, controller=player)` at end of `cast_spell` and `cast_spell_free` in `engine/casting.py` → cards 226, 257\n       - **B**: Fire `AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature=attacker, attacker=attacker)` in `declare_attackers_step` in `engine/combat.py` → card 1\n       - **C**: Add `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, is_first_main)` to `events.py`, fire in `run_turn` for PRECOMBAT_MAIN (is_first_main=True) and POSTCOMBAT_MAIN → cards 57, 120\n       - **D**: In `get_cost_reduction` (`engine/casting.py`), sum `grant_cost_reduction(game, card)` from controller's battlefield permanents (via hasattr) → card 245\n       - **E**: In `_resolve_spell`, non-permanent branch uses `Zone.EXILE if getattr(card,\"_exile_on_resolve\",False) else Zone.GRAVEYARD` → cards 1, 120\n       - **F**: In `cast_spell`, after payment set `card.mana_spent = effective_cost.cmc` → card 57\n       - **G**: Reset `cards_drawn_this_turn = 0` for every player in `_do_untap_step` (`engine/turn.py`) → card 201\n       - **H**: Honor per-player `_turns_to_skip` at top of `run_turn` (decrement, advance_phase until turn_number changes, return) → card 97\n\n   - **`engine/card.py`** (read): CardImpl base + hooks; Creature has `base_power/base_toughness/modified_power/modified_toughness/plus_one_counters/_base_plus_one_counters`; `_reset_characteristics()` resets card_types, keywords (Creature also P/T, protections). Land.can_cast returns False.\n\n   - **`engine/casting.py`** (read): `cast_spell` (pipeline: timing→can_cast→hand→stack→targets→cost reduction→pay→on_cast→push); `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)` exists; `_resolve_spell` moves I/S stack→graveyard with NO replacement event; `get_cost_reduction` calls `card.cost_reduction(game)` clamped to generic; sets `card.colors_spent = list(player.mana_pool.last_payment_colors)`.\n\n   - **`engine/stack.py`** (read): `copy_spell(game, original_stack_obj, controller, new_targets=None)` shallow-copies source card, returns StackObject; `priority_loop` pops top, calls on_resolve.\n\n   - **`engine/triggers.py`** (read): `TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller)`; effect callback gets only `(game)`.\n\n   - **`engine/zones.py`** (read): `move_to_zone(game, card, from_zone, to_zone, replacement_event=None)` — replacements only when `from_zone == BATTLEFIELD`; auto-registers triggers on entering battlefield.\n\n   - **`engine/combat.py`** (read partial): `declare_attackers_step` sets `attacker.is_attacking = True` but does NOT fire AttacksTriggeredEvent.\n\n   - **`engine/turn.py`** (read): `run_turn` loop; `_do_untap_step` clears tapped/summoning_sick, resets land_plays; upkeep fires `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent()` (no player); cleanup calls `effect_manager.remove_expired` + `apply_all`.\n\n   - **`engine/game.py`**